{
  "contentId": "1212297337",
  "title": "十九届六中全会防控标准",
  "body": "<table data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-UnlEcgYJ\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-nFAqdtkr\"><th data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5vMdunHB\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QX0r6VUY\"><strong>风险点</strong></p></th><th data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7LPQ8JpQ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-F7C9v1dM\">标准细则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-uyjrbP0l\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hvZFwXbN\">文字案例</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-plJZPyVC\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2TmyHrF7\">图片案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-oJKpK7sR\"><td rowspan=\"3\" data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7c6Yvr8S\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-75DVf2Rw\"><strong>涉政负面</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-jN3JfAq9\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KHFhmTCt\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-kjxVZ2sf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zD9KWNso\">涉及攻击国家党政，攻击十九届六中全会召开，揣测会议延迟原因、人事变动、内斗严重等阴谋论内容，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-utlSdkZf\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9IGQ2tE0\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-l9CTHbUF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-mb2ahJOi\">“中共六中全会罕见推迟 党媒刊文暗藏高层激斗信号”</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-l9CTHbUF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b1ZkCeBS\">\"<span style=\"color: \">如果拖到11月份开，意味着中共党内有激烈的斗争，各方需要更多时间来磋商\"</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-uE8EqAzG\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fki9jdsh\">六中全会前夕人事一日大换血，遭制裁封疆大吏提拔要职。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-TJH1c6Z9\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rtNMYCN1\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 280px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377985?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266249784?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377984?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"280\" data-height=\"228\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-3wOB2w7H\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-51AgUfGo\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-AQzpXGVq\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-krim3CAT\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ukvpuuO5\">涉及讽刺、内涵会议开展为领导人连任铺路、映射领导人独裁等负面内容，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4Ww4tfZZ\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CR3uiV4u\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-cKvXoyhZ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-S9gOkBRb\">“其关联性就在于这份历史决议把习近平的地位抬得越高，那么他二十大连任的正当性和合法性就会越强。”</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-cKvXoyhZ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-SGiQnja6\">“<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">所以你要说腊肉在名义上独裁皇帝无限连任，人家真没有，毛泽东形式上还是要脸的。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">在习近平之前，中国没有超过担任十年两任以上国家主席的人，一个都没有。</span>”</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-i7e2zEIe\"></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-AwgLs6Ej\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bEjAwRuH\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 278px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377814?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971088?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971089?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"278\" data-height=\"155\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-Cg05I9aX\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-RWz8kzRZ\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9jV3lLV9\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-z3Dbs80T\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1AyXEHkY\">涉及歪曲、过度解读会议内容，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-TVPZk3dR\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-OBxsbY4Q\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-N3DvQqru\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-yNcOtFCl\">习近平要通过制定<strong>第三个历史决议</strong>，“把毛和邓捏到一起”，把中共高层精英的思想统一在他的框架内。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-UQPAwS1P\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-iUnIdqoE\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 319px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377817?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377816?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377988?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"319\" data-height=\"291\"></span>​<span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 173px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266297334?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266297333?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266259418?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"173\" data-height=\"181\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-EUCwlhHI\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-aa3e49b6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5o5eJK2K\"><strong>历史虚无主义</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-BADwXla1\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VgqkcnAt\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-bT4TH2W6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-gZyOC5Tb\"><span style=\"color: \">涉及否认历代领导人历史功绩</span>，否认、歪曲<span style=\"color: \">中共百年取得的成就，特别是中共十八大后取得的成就，需打击。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-FqqNscuH\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cZ1M30eY\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-0HG7o2AP\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VAbILfWC\"><span style=\"color: \">中国问题学者陈奎德表示，与今年年初发行的新版《中国共产党简史》遥相呼应，这份新决议将淡化前任领导人的成就，但会高歌习近平上任九年来的大政方针。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-uq6iK103\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ODFfyJ5l\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 319px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266259419?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266334766?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377820?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"319\" data-height=\"107\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-nPuCbZBk\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9Cr1PnWX\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qj7tx7Hb\">文化大革命</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dZvTbMHt\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-9bar9dGB\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XPIQcvXv\">涉及“重评文革”，否认官方对文革定性，引发对该事件性质争论和分歧的言论，需打击。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-stlTgkSK\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fxauBMrH\">借文革等历史事件，攻击讽刺党政规避过往错误，避重就轻的言论，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fgnkihTr\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-w6GeQtPB\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-GtVZuGlp\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-27Jwq1r9\"><span style=\"color: \">并对中共在这些阶段中取得的“伟大成就”高调地做了定性，却只字不提大跃进、文革、六四等重大危机和人道灾难。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-T3LIKeOm\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZrsylhzX\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-FLyRbkCz\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-xWZ3eYxK\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dAZsv3GA\"><strong>境外有害</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-hCEV6EiE\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-qycybRX5\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-dvexWyfM\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7YoVTgsX\">涉及借疫情反弹，政府管理失职关联十九届六中全会等负面内容，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-YPrljNTn\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-sCSQ6Ih3\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-BYgR4gfY\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ujoY67uO\">疫情又反弹了，还在这开会呢</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wO7XbpaF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZGPVQl53\">六中全会临近疫情攻京入冀河北省委书记喊话</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-VHWihGyd\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2p1yN3MQ\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-pWNd3ZXj\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-3HaM269w\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6V7ACQDD\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-he5uH3HB\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-IQBQAaH3\">境外反华势力借大会发声，攻击党和领导人的内容需打击</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-XKe7LzD0\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-S6m723SZ\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-2WsyjA0I\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-C03Cz8Ni\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">郭文贵：此次</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">六中全会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">将有多人被抓、被杀；不灭共，谁也不会安全</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Gw8PufVs\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KNBBSmeP\">美国之音：专访傅士卓，重新思考中国政治与中共十九届六中全会前瞻</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-k2GPTwya\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-I2SH6vbr\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 319px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266334669?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971091?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266334668?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"319\" data-height=\"178\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-J0LPMcl1\"><td rowspan=\"4\" data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-SXzEPzcY\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zV6FMdiI\"><strong>舆情事件</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-03p9wPgP\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-L2Vj1W7E\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-q05VC1LA\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-tqXsUees\">涉及借近日高热舆情事件（女权相关争议、LGBTQ+账号被封等），煽动特殊群体维权示威，甚至是与境外势力勾联互动相关导向内容，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-vRmq2DCi\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TYOt6eP4\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-UO7puJZH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hTgMFOQv\">提出“暖被窝工程”的政协委员抓起来了么？这种厌女咖不会也去参会了吧？</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-zskSQOGp\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-BoOqEMpr\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 243px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971093?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971092?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266334767?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"243\" data-height=\"232\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-8durc9SU\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-PQU5FGhY\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-npOOq9JF\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-bfP5htcr\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-GOAjgOAK\">将大会前后热点舆情、政策法规等强行串联，编造阴谋论的内容需打击</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b139sINs\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Lk5rqp2i\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wAAIxKP0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fymNczeC\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">每次大会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">前的扫黄，把女的扫出来了，从交代出来的客户名单里挑了个名气大的报道。每年都一样。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Wyk6JE2w\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MaOIdXEn\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">大会前瞻：房产税</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">方案遭党内压倒性反对，常委谏言叫停，或重回双轨制</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-jRW4xinT\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VbzoMuXh\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 319px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266297336?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377540?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266377539?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"319\" data-height=\"200\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-TC7s0iAz\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-HSQp8qeu\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ADIB1ocI\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-IYj0kAmr\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Wq0bMAzu\"><span style=\"color: \">会议期间北京突发重大凶杀、交通事故、灾害、暴恐事件等血腥暴力、惨烈现场等信息需打击</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-XSB5BjVg\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-HCdPJwBp\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-36AzRP0r\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0y1dbXRC\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-y31SYn1X\"><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-qGSW22nN\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-g6JDlARM\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ud6d6diG\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ow5egGjo\">会议期间<span style=\"color: \">涉及游行、维稳、上访信息的需打击</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5NhZoPPL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-tIgMMgon\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-rqXbSjTd\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-DPNihJmo\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-3bYM1bnB\"><td data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Eied7WO5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2DgkMP9R\"><strong>意识形态</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-m6YMNtxF\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-LJ3rvUad\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-E36Vkyky\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-C173gipZ\">十九届六中全会期间发表攻击我国意识形态，发表“崇美”“跪美”，过度吹捧<span style=\"color: rgb(43, 43, 43)\">西方世界治理模式等非主流意识形态的，需打击。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-gEnLO8eS\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-WmPgU6zM\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-oBkdizUw\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4TnmLUHy\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-6TjArBPS\"><td data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-jBmP7Sag\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-lemCny61\"><strong>行业高热</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-XlMZk9bB\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-81c2dhrJ\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Vc0pjRhN\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-rxN9Ymrx\">十九届六中全会期间借各大厂被罚，攻击党政和国家政策的，需打击。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-PvdySeQP\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-BEqzvMK6\">十九届六中全会期间关联教育、游戏等行业受监管影响，导致裁员失业并以此攻击、嘲讽、贬低、质疑国家政策相关内容，讽刺我国文化不自信，自我阉割的，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-j0hotgwE\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KrTuU0qN\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-YXdpad4g\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xCul4YGX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">第三季度GDP已经跌到4.9%了，疫情管制已经让经济增长进入不可逆的颓势，加上打击游戏、教育、房地产这些支柱产业将就业给拉垮了，增长的动力一下子没了。如果再不转变思路，以后高增长将不在是中国的专利了，中国很有可能变成下一个阿根廷。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-HbQ6hyV6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JyaIOXhp\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">去年10月，阿里巴巴，滴滴打车，到视频游戏、教育培训、金融科技、食品配送、加密货币，以及最近的房地产领域，一年来，北京监管行动持续不断、层出不穷，几乎每月一次甚至数次。最新动向，习近平又开始对中国25家金融机构展开调查，其中甚至可能会涉及一些与国家副主席王岐山关系密切的人和机构。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ks49xUJS\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-F4J7VzfI\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 240px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266249785?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1266297338?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1212297337/1265971095?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"240\" data-height=\"215\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-qZXLWMHF\"><td data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-nUT0yZu0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-egGr8AOn\"><strong>营销内容</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2YIeg1c2\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Tbkkd13Q\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-sixkc3HH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ABFK7Clf\">借十九届六中全会进行营销活动的，需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0cJwwG9z\">备注：双十一恰逢十九届六中全会闭幕，需格外注意。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-V7ErgpMH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-y8YdAKMt\">关联建党百年，蹭建党百年热度，关联会议、党史相关的违规产品，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2YIeg1c2\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-UQzIcloz\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-yvzKyUkV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TNFUwgyq\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">十八届六中全会十二个关键词，5118VIP会员优惠码F5834D」</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-tQE22q99\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XFDZqtXW\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">11月11日是</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">六中全会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">最后</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">一</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">天，预计《关于党的百年奋斗重大成就和历史经验的决议》光辉出炉。这日子选得有意思：外盖格拉斯哥气候峰会（12日闭幕）风头，内压</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">双十一</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">购物节狂欢。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-OhMbamvH\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XKOJdnf2\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-RvE1IP0t\"><td data-colwidth=\"104\" width=\"104\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-DfqTuvEF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-igF6vBxA\"><strong>双十一营销</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"360\" width=\"360\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ayJZ4R1F\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ScEXleMu\">十九届六中全会期间，涉双十一营销合规：</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bglGWtZX\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-OI2tyEoa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1zjz7UdD\">广告内容不得使用绝对化、顶级禁用词汇：“全国最佳”、“全国第一”等相关词汇</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-OI2tyEoa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-NF3KkJlO\">广告内容不得直接或间接贬低竞争对手的产品、服务，如声称自己的产品、服务的质量、价格等都比竞争对手好。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-OI2tyEoa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-It1go4ob\">广告内容不得损害未成年人和残疾人的身心健康。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-OI2tyEoa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9aIvVcuQ\">广告内容不得利用社会热点事件、名人宣传自己的产品、服务。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-tyvDflDx\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-PIY3xQ52\">广告内容中不得使用未授权的商标或文字，如使用应取得对应商标授权，如双十一、双十二或天猫双十一logo等。具体可参考：<a class=\"ct-link\" href=\"https://km.sankuai.com/page/109267446\" data-pageid=\"109267446\" data-auto_update=\"1\">https://km.sankuai.com/page/109267446</a></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"414\" width=\"414\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ayJZ4R1F\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zwOdQ52A\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"343\" width=\"343\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-S58qzEUy\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VgG80fze\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zjQfaOgv\"></p>",
